{"seq":2,"slug":"color-theory","title":"大学设计学 — 色彩理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/design-foundations/color-theory","wordCount":1442,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学设计学-色彩理论\">大学设计学 — 色彩理论</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>色彩是人类视觉系统中最敏感的信息通道，设计师对色彩的运用能力直接决定作品的情感传达效率。色彩理论从物理光学、生理感知和心理认知三个层面构建了一套完整的分析与应用框架。牛顿在1666年用棱镜分解白光，揭示了光谱的客观存在；歌德则从主观感受出发，提出了色彩的心理效应理论；伊顿在包豪斯将两者融合，形成了现代设计教育中的色彩学体系。</p>\n<p>色彩的基本属性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>英文</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>度量方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>色相</td>\n<td>Hue</td>\n<td>色彩的基本面貌</td>\n<td>色环角度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0°</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>360</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">360°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">360°</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>明度</td>\n<td>Value/Lightness</td>\n<td>色彩的明暗程度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（黑）至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>（白）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饱和度</td>\n<td>Saturation/Chroma</td>\n<td>色彩的纯度与鲜艳程度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（灰）至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>（纯色）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"色彩模型与色彩空间\">色彩模型与色彩空间</h3><p>设计实践中涉及多种色彩模型。RGB（红、绿、蓝）是加色模型，用于屏幕显示——三色光叠加趋向白色。CMYK（青、品红、黄、黑）是减色模型，用于印刷——颜料混合趋向黑色。HSL/HSB 模型以人类感知为基础，将色彩分解为色相、饱和度和明度三个直觉维度，更适合设计师进行色彩选择。</p>\n<p>色彩空间定义了色彩模型的具体覆盖范围。sRGB 是互联网标准色彩空间，覆盖了人眼可见光谱的约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35%</span></span></span></span></span>。Adobe RGB 扩展到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>，适合印刷前期工作。P3 色彩空间覆盖约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">45\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45%</span></span></span></span></span>，是当前高端显示器（如 Apple Retina）的标准。设计师需要根据最终输出媒介选择正确的色彩空间，否则屏幕上看到的颜色和印刷品之间会出现显著色差。</p>\n<h3 id=\"色环与配色方案\">色环与配色方案</h3><p>色环（Color Wheel）是色彩关系的可视化工具。12色色环将三原色（红、黄、蓝）、三间色（橙、绿、紫）和六复色等距排列，构成色彩搭配的基础参照系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[单色配色 Monochromatic] --&gt;|同色相不同明度饱和度| G[统一宁静]&#10;    B[互补配色 Complementary] --&gt;|色环对角180°| H[强烈对比]&#10;    C[类似配色 Analogous] --&gt;|色环相邻30°-60°| I[和谐自然]&#10;    D[分裂互补 Split-Complementary] --&gt;|互补色两侧各30°| J[丰富且稳定]&#10;    E[三角配色 Triadic] --&gt;|色环等距120°| K[活力平衡]&#10;    F[四角配色 Tetradic] --&gt;|两组互补色| L[丰富但需谨慎]\">graph TD\n    A[单色配色 Monochromatic] --&gt;|同色相不同明度饱和度| G[统一宁静]\n    B[互补配色 Complementary] --&gt;|色环对角180°| H[强烈对比]\n    C[类似配色 Analogous] --&gt;|色环相邻30°-60°| I[和谐自然]\n    D[分裂互补 Split-Complementary] --&gt;|互补色两侧各30°| J[丰富且稳定]\n    E[三角配色 Triadic] --&gt;|色环等距120°| K[活力平衡]\n    F[四角配色 Tetradic] --&gt;|两组互补色| L[丰富但需谨慎]</pre><p>在实际设计中，60-30-10 法则提供了配色比例的经验指导：主色占面积的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span>，辅助色占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>，强调色占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>。这一比例源自室内设计领域，但在平面设计、网页设计和品牌设计中同样适用。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>视觉和谐</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>dominant</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>secondary</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>accent</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{视觉和谐} \\approx 60\\% \\times C_{\\text{dominant}} + 30\\% \\times C_{\\text{secondary}} + 10\\% \\times C_{\\text{accent}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">视觉和谐</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dominant</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">secondary</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"色彩的心理与文化效应\">色彩的心理与文化效应</h3><p>色彩的心理效应具有一定的跨文化普遍性，但也存在显著的文化差异。红色在中国文化中象征喜庆与吉祥，在西方却常关联危险与警告。白色在东亚传统中与丧葬相关，在欧美文化中则代表纯洁。设计师在进行跨文化设计时，必须审慎考虑目标受众的文化语境。</p>\n<p>色彩在情绪引导上的研究较为丰富：暖色调（红、橙、黄）倾向于激发能量和紧迫感，冷色调（蓝、绿、紫）倾向于传达平静和信任感。医疗机构偏好蓝绿色调营造安全感，快餐品牌大量使用红黄组合刺激食欲和加速决策——这些都是色彩心理学在商业设计中的成熟应用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对比度与无障碍设计\">对比度与无障碍设计</h3><p>WCAG（Web Content Accessibility Guidelines）规定了文本与背景之间的最低对比度标准。普通文本要求对比度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>4.5</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 4.5:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，大文本要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 3:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。对比度的计算基于相对亮度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Contrast Ratio</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Contrast Ratio} = \\frac{L_1 + 0.05}{L_2 + 0.05}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Contrast Ratio</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是较亮和较暗颜色的相对亮度值。约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span> 的男性和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5%</span></span></span></span></span> 的女性存在色觉缺陷，设计师应避免仅依赖色彩差异传递关键信息，同时使用形状、图标或文字标签作为冗余编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>使用 HSL 模型，为一个健康类 App 创建单色配色方案和互补配色方案各一套，比较两者传达的品牌感受。</li>\n<li>收集五个知名品牌的标志色，分析它们在色环上的位置关系，思考色彩选择与品牌定位之间的关联。</li>\n<li>使用在线对比度检测工具（如 WebAIM Contrast Checker），检测你常用的三个网站是否满足 WCAG AA 标准。</li>\n<li>选取同一张照片，分别用暖色调和冷色调进行后期调色，记录两种处理对画面情绪的不同影响。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>约翰内斯·伊顿的《色彩艺术》是设计院校的经典教材，从色彩对比的七种类型展开系统讲解。约瑟夫·阿尔伯斯的《色彩互动学》则通过大量实验证明色彩感知的相对性——同一颜色在不同背景上会呈现截然不同的视觉效果。对于数字设计领域，推荐学习 Material Design 和 Apple Human Interface Guidelines 中的色彩系统章节，了解工业级色彩规范的构建方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>色彩理论横跨物理、生理和心理三个层面，为设计师提供了从科学到感性的完整认知链条。掌握色彩模型和色彩空间的区别，能避免跨媒介输出的色差问题；理解配色方案和比例法则，能在实践中快速建立和谐的色彩体系；关注无障碍对比度标准，则确保设计作品服务于最广泛的用户群体。接下来将进入字体设计领域，探讨文字作为视觉元素的造型逻辑。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学设计学 — 色彩理论","id":"大学设计学-色彩理论"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"色彩模型与色彩空间","id":"色彩模型与色彩空间"},{"level":3,"text":"色环与配色方案","id":"色环与配色方案"},{"level":3,"text":"色彩的心理与文化效应","id":"色彩的心理与文化效应"},{"level":3,"text":"对比度与无障碍设计","id":"对比度与无障碍设计"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学设计学 — 设计原理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/design-foundations/design-principles"},"next":{"title":"大学设计学 — 字体设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/design/design-foundations/typography"}}